Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.32,0:00:03.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How was your day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.88,0:00:05.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:10.50,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\pos(245,275)\fad(100,100)}FINAL NOTICE\NKEN\NTime left to live
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.70,0:00:11.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ken, you have four minutes left.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.61,0:00:12.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:13.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Four minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.77,0:00:15.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dinner will be ready by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.02,0:00:17.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.81,0:00:27.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cancel this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.65,0:00:30.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can turn notifications off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.60,0:00:32.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not the notification.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.63,0:00:34.63,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\pos(245,275)\fad(100,100)}Muted.\NTime cannot be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.37,0:00:38.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.24,0:00:39.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.99,0:00:41.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... I only have...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:43.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:47.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:00:59.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,While you're there,\Nget the plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.50,0:01:01.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not now. I don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.46,0:01:03.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what you always say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:05.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.73,0:01:11.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.76,0:01:16.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.78,0:01:24.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How was your day?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.01,0:01:26.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.77,0:01:30.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.35,0:01:43.25,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\pos(245,275)\fad(100,100)}FINAL NOTICE\NKEN\NTime left to live
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.02,0:01:44.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Final notice...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.59,0:01:49.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.15,0:01:53.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.58,0:01:58.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. But... you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.88,0:02:03.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't you stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.17,0:02:07.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It says I can't change it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:23.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom. Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:29.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.94,0:02:36.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:53.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.06,0:02:59.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just... need to say this right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.66,0:03:04.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At a time like this,\NI should...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:12.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to find\Nthe right words.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.46,0:03:17.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.44,0:03:21.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.49,0:03:28.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.41,0:03:38.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.71,0:03:42.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.05,0:03:45.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.33,0:04:07.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.13,0:04:14.63,Closing,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,465)\fad(1000,1000)}Tell them how you feel\Nwhile you still can.
